        "original_id": "10cc70f5-2fb4-5794-aa04-1f2cc396ef64",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: K. Shivaram Karanth\n- Topics: Yakshagana, Marali Mannige\n\nFacts:\n- K. Shivaram Karanth was born on 10 October 1902 and died on 9 December 1997.\n- K. Shivaram Karanth was a Kannada writer, social activist, environmentalist, Yakshagana artist, film maker, and thinker.\n- Yakshagana is a traditional theatre form in Kannada and Tulu culture.\n- Yakshagana combines dance, music, dialogue, costume, make-up, and stage techniques in a unique style and form.\n- Marali Mannige is a Kannada novel by K. Shivaram Karanth.",
